--- fairness: assume {s_eventually !stall}
property                     type    status        engine     detail
a_live                       assert  proven        informal-ic3 0.09 s
a_idle                       assert  cex           informal-ic3 depth 3 in 0.04 s
a_step                       assert  proven        informal-ic3 0.07 s
a_until                      assert  proven        informal-ic3 0.07 s
a_wuntil                     assert  proven        informal-ic3 0.04 s
m_fair                       assume  unprocessed              
